WEBVTT

01:58.760 --> 02:01.600
All four regional military commanders
enter the Capital tomorrow.

02:02.800 --> 02:04.200
Once they enter the Capital,

02:04.280 --> 02:06.120
they must surely know
that they face the danger

02:06.200 --> 02:08.639
of losing military authority.

02:09.280 --> 02:11.000
They won't submit easily.

02:15.680 --> 02:17.320
Let's take a guess

02:17.400 --> 02:18.920
at the kinds of plots
they'll come up with.

02:19.760 --> 02:20.760
How much can we guess?

02:24.040 --> 02:25.200
Where's Gu Yu?

02:25.280 --> 02:26.360
Can he make it in time?

02:28.560 --> 02:32.320
Xie Huai'an is already
preparing a rescue plan.

02:33.400 --> 02:34.880
He's out of our control.

02:36.000 --> 02:37.360
We can't predict his moves.

02:43.000 --> 02:44.760
Back in the day,

02:46.120 --> 02:49.080
we were able to anticipate many things.

02:50.040 --> 02:52.040
Same for this military campaign
against Chang'an.

02:52.120 --> 02:55.280
We also knew that the useless soldiers

02:55.360 --> 02:57.520
under my brother's command

02:57.600 --> 02:58.920
were unable to hold the city gates.

02:59.520 --> 03:01.400
Now that we've won ourselves an empire,

03:02.080 --> 03:03.240
it feels the further we go,

03:03.840 --> 03:07.560
the more uncertainties we'll face.

03:11.520 --> 03:12.800
Perhaps, as the saying goes,

03:14.120 --> 03:15.360
"It's easier to seize power

03:16.440 --> 03:17.800
than to hold onto it."

04:53.560 --> 04:55.840
How's the situation outside?

04:59.040 --> 05:01.680
The four commanders have arrived,
moving discreetly.

05:02.720 --> 05:04.040
Luckily, Xiaoqing was able to find out.

05:05.960 --> 05:07.200
Do you truly think

05:07.280 --> 05:10.160
Gao Yan, Xiao Wuyang, and the rest
plan to strike the commanders?

05:11.280 --> 05:13.200
They will, if we fail to rescue Gu Yu

05:14.360 --> 05:15.440
in time.

05:16.520 --> 05:20.000
Instead of letting the commanders
align themselves with the Huben Army,

05:20.080 --> 05:22.960
we should kill them first.

05:24.120 --> 05:25.640
With Chancellor Gao's capabilities,

05:26.400 --> 05:28.480
he would pacify the four towns

05:28.560 --> 05:30.240
while cutting down the commanders.

05:31.000 --> 05:33.880
Perhaps he has already dispatched his men.

05:35.200 --> 05:36.640
Now that Gu Yu is captured,

05:36.720 --> 05:39.040
undercurrents are stirring once more
under the city of Chang'an.

05:39.120 --> 05:40.280
As for Gu Yu,

05:41.480 --> 05:42.480
I've already found him.

05:45.040 --> 05:46.000
You found him?

05:46.840 --> 05:47.720
We should act, then.

05:47.800 --> 05:49.360
A war will start in the city, you know?

05:50.520 --> 05:51.720
Let's wait a little longer.

05:51.800 --> 05:53.600
I have something else in mind.

05:56.360 --> 05:59.200
Hand this to Chancellor Gao.

06:00.000 --> 06:02.800
He'll hold his position
once he reads this.

06:02.880 --> 06:05.000
-Can I read this?
-Of course.

06:05.720 --> 06:07.680
I'm just worried
that you cannot understand it.

06:08.760 --> 06:09.600
I won't read it, then.

06:11.400 --> 06:13.160
Tell the pageboy to keep a close eye
on Wang Xing.

06:13.240 --> 06:14.880
Is he doing things properly?

06:17.000 --> 06:17.960
It's a long story.

06:18.040 --> 06:19.480
But I'll summarize it.

06:20.480 --> 06:21.920
He has already done Wang Xing in.

06:24.840 --> 06:26.400
But it wasn't not his fault.

06:26.480 --> 06:28.440
Anyway, you should stop worrying.

06:28.520 --> 06:30.640
Finish your task inside.
We'll talk once you're out.

06:32.000 --> 06:32.840
All right.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.240
Make way!

06:46.960 --> 06:49.120
Watch where you're going!

06:50.800 --> 06:52.440
Mother, we have a customer.

06:53.000 --> 06:54.080
A customer?

06:54.640 --> 06:58.800
-If so, get him some food later, okay?
-Miss. Get me two buns.

06:58.880 --> 07:00.240
Coming right up.

07:05.360 --> 07:06.400
It's hot. Be careful.

07:13.800 --> 07:16.920
Eat up. My mother's buns are delicious.

07:19.440 --> 07:21.840
What about your father?

07:21.920 --> 07:23.760
I don't remember who my father is.

07:23.840 --> 07:26.560
Mother said it's been three years
since he last returned.

07:26.640 --> 07:27.680
My wife

07:28.280 --> 07:32.080
often wears a purple dress,
faded from all the washing.

07:35.240 --> 07:37.040
You'll know when you see her.

07:41.680 --> 07:47.840
LIU'S BAMBOO SHOP

08:05.080 --> 08:06.080
‎Come on.

08:06.160 --> 08:07.800
I'll make you something nice
when we're back.

08:11.120 --> 08:13.520
-Mother, are you tired?
-Not at all.

08:25.880 --> 08:26.800
Young lady.

08:29.200 --> 08:30.280
Young lady.

08:32.280 --> 08:33.640
Young lady.

08:33.720 --> 08:34.880
Young lady.

08:39.960 --> 08:40.960
Young lady.

08:41.039 --> 08:42.760
Young lady, open up.

08:45.120 --> 08:46.320
Stop hiding.

08:46.400 --> 08:49.560
I just want to help you guys out.

08:49.640 --> 08:51.080
It's already been two months.

08:51.160 --> 08:52.960
Why are you still avoiding me?

08:53.720 --> 08:54.720
I know

08:54.800 --> 08:58.080
that your shop is right here.

08:58.600 --> 09:00.520
Your daughter is still very young.

09:00.600 --> 09:02.120
And you're alone.

09:02.200 --> 09:03.560
You have only two eyes.

09:03.640 --> 09:05.320
You won't be able
to watch her every moment.

09:05.400 --> 09:07.520
Mother. I'm scared.

09:09.520 --> 09:10.800
I'm here for you.

09:13.280 --> 09:14.000
Young lady!

09:14.640 --> 09:16.080
Young lady, open the door!

09:45.400 --> 09:48.320
Mother. Let's call Father back.

09:48.400 --> 09:51.040
-Let's call Father back.
-Okay.

09:51.120 --> 09:52.680
I'll write to your father now.

09:52.760 --> 09:54.320
I'll ask him to return at once, all right?

09:55.240 --> 09:56.240
Stop crying.

10:12.080 --> 10:14.000
Mister. I want a bowl of noodles.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.000
Give me extra vegetables.

10:15.600 --> 10:17.600
‎Please cut some raddish for me.

10:17.680 --> 10:19.040
-I'll come back for it later.
-Okay.

10:30.320 --> 10:33.240
Say, you still have a habit of being late
even after all these years, huh?

10:34.280 --> 10:35.400
Lamb won't be as tasty

10:35.480 --> 10:37.360
if you cook it for too long.

10:38.880 --> 10:40.320
Are we here just to eat lamb?

10:41.040 --> 10:43.480
Didn't we return to Chang'an
to devour other people?

10:43.560 --> 10:45.240
Not necessarily.

10:45.320 --> 10:47.840
If we do a bad job,
we'll be devoured instead.

10:52.080 --> 10:54.400
Can you guys talk about something
that won't spoil my appetite?

10:55.840 --> 10:57.280
If I'm not mistaken,

10:57.360 --> 10:59.280
when we followed the founding emperor
into Chang'an,

10:59.360 --> 11:00.960
we had our first meal here.

11:01.040 --> 11:03.400
No wonder you settled here
after searching everywhere.

11:03.480 --> 11:06.320
Thirty years ago, after that meal,
we followed the founding emperor

11:07.280 --> 11:08.760
into the palace.

11:09.560 --> 11:11.000
He conquered the empire

11:11.920 --> 11:13.520
while we seized the military seals.

11:14.480 --> 11:15.480
I told you already.

11:16.080 --> 11:17.680
This is a lucky spot.

11:18.280 --> 11:20.160
But 30 years passed
in the blink of an eye.

11:20.760 --> 11:22.360
The founding emperor is long gone.

11:22.440 --> 11:26.360
And now, his son
wants to take back our military seals.

11:28.400 --> 11:30.280
If we agree to it,

11:30.360 --> 11:31.600
it'll mean

11:32.200 --> 11:34.240
that our lifetime will be in vain.

11:36.360 --> 11:39.080
Is there really no room for maneuver
in this matter?

11:42.120 --> 11:43.640
Our lives may not be in vain after all.

11:44.240 --> 11:47.160
If that does happen,
at least I still own this alley.

11:52.000 --> 11:55.160
A few years ago,
I spent some money and bought this alley.

11:55.240 --> 11:58.360
The lamb we're having
is served by my shop.

11:59.360 --> 12:00.880
You're something else indeed.

12:00.960 --> 12:02.920
-You're a cunning old fox.
-You are hogging all the food.

12:41.440 --> 12:43.680
-Have all of their men arrived?
-They have.

12:44.280 --> 12:45.320
What about our men?

12:45.400 --> 12:46.480
Our men have arrived as well.

12:46.560 --> 12:48.160
Chancellor, we await your command.

12:51.640 --> 12:54.400
On the night of murder,
one should savor tea to the fullest.

13:03.360 --> 13:05.680
ABUNDANT FORTUNE

13:21.080 --> 13:23.400
You're not acting yourself today.

13:24.000 --> 13:26.200
You see, it's a long story.

13:26.280 --> 13:27.680
Consider this my penance.

13:31.200 --> 13:34.280
Your expression, tone,
and the way you act…

13:35.840 --> 13:37.520
You look more like a hired blade.

13:37.600 --> 13:39.760
Those who don't know might think
that you're one of my peers.

13:39.840 --> 13:42.280
So, why are we meeting here?

13:42.880 --> 13:45.400
Now, I just want to go home
and have a bowl of hot porridge.

13:46.080 --> 13:47.080
Forget about the porridge.

13:49.280 --> 13:50.360
Let's have some hot tea.

13:54.000 --> 13:55.680
Tonight, Chancellor Gao
will make his move here.

13:55.760 --> 13:57.120
He means to kill the four commanders.

13:59.040 --> 13:59.880
What?

13:59.960 --> 14:01.120
Don't act so surprised.

14:01.200 --> 14:04.040
Our current mission
is to prevent that from happening.

14:06.600 --> 14:09.600
Chancellor Gao
is having tea in that tea house now.

14:09.680 --> 14:10.880
The commanders

14:11.400 --> 14:13.280
are having lamb hotpot in that very alley.

14:14.640 --> 14:15.880
And us? Must we just

14:16.840 --> 14:17.880
stand here like fools?

14:23.160 --> 14:24.320
Take this to Chancellor Gao.

14:24.400 --> 14:26.880
Huai'an said Chancellor Gao
would stop his operation immediately

14:26.960 --> 14:27.840
after seeing this.

14:34.680 --> 14:35.680
Why not go yourself?

14:36.360 --> 14:37.680
Chancellor Gao has set a trap inside.

14:37.760 --> 14:39.640
I'm sure there are many assassins
lying in wait.

14:39.720 --> 14:41.960
I have to locate the assassins first.

14:42.040 --> 14:43.160
What if something goes wrong?

14:43.840 --> 14:45.040
Can you fend them off?

14:46.240 --> 14:47.080
You're right.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.920
-Can you understand it?
-Of course.

14:59.840 --> 15:00.840
This is a huge deal.

15:01.600 --> 15:03.320
Chancellor Gao will stop at once
if he hears this.

15:06.520 --> 15:07.480
Keep this safe.

15:07.560 --> 15:08.680
Huai'an said His Majesty

15:08.760 --> 15:11.080
gave him the Marquis of Wuyang's
official seal himself.

15:11.160 --> 15:14.040
With it, one can move freely
throughout Chang'an.

15:21.000 --> 15:22.320
That's Chancellor Gao's messenger.

15:23.520 --> 15:26.040
They'll commence the operation soon.
I have to stop them.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.440
Don't mess this up.

15:30.800 --> 15:31.840
Hey!

15:31.920 --> 15:32.760
I…

15:36.560 --> 15:37.640
The tea house?

15:38.760 --> 15:40.360
Where is it?

15:43.440 --> 15:46.280
HALL OF TALENT

15:53.200 --> 15:55.080
According to Chancellor Gao,
tonight is the night…

15:56.760 --> 15:58.080
Who are you?

15:58.160 --> 16:00.600
According to Chancellor Gao, all of you

16:01.480 --> 16:02.840
have to remain here tonight.

16:11.640 --> 16:12.680
That darned Ye Zheng.

16:13.240 --> 16:14.560
He only gave me a direction.

16:15.080 --> 16:17.520
He didn't give me
the tea house's exact location.

16:17.600 --> 16:18.440
I…

16:23.840 --> 16:25.560
-Who's there?
-Who's there?

16:25.640 --> 16:27.720
I wish you all prosperity.

16:33.960 --> 16:35.240
LONGSHENG INN

16:51.080 --> 16:52.000
Who's there?

16:59.000 --> 17:00.160
I bear the Marquis of Wuyang's seal.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.120
I must see the chancellor.

17:05.280 --> 17:07.119
Chancellor, someone came with the seal
His Majesty had given.

17:07.200 --> 17:08.720
-He says it's urgent…
-Get out of the way.

17:09.480 --> 17:12.040
I came to tell you
not to kill the commanders.

17:12.119 --> 17:13.359
But now I must tell you

17:13.440 --> 17:14.800
they mean to kill you.

17:14.880 --> 17:16.720
Therefore, you have to escape.

17:20.400 --> 17:21.720
In just one night,

17:22.720 --> 17:25.599
you managed to uncover two deadly plots.

17:28.119 --> 17:29.320
Who are you?

17:31.680 --> 17:33.800
I'm Mr. Xie Huai'an's pageboy.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.000
This seal is the proof.

17:38.320 --> 17:41.120
Xie Huai'an is remarkably intelligent.

17:41.200 --> 17:42.600
It seems the pageboy he has chosen

17:43.720 --> 17:45.120
is pretty intelligent as well.

17:47.960 --> 17:50.720
How did you find out
that they were after my life?

17:51.880 --> 17:53.840
Their hitmen
are waiting at the tavern right next door.

17:53.920 --> 17:56.560
All of them carried military blades.
I could tell at first glance.

18:00.760 --> 18:02.360
LONGSHENG INN

18:08.720 --> 18:09.920
I suppose it's time.

18:10.000 --> 18:12.400
They should be acting as we speak.

18:14.680 --> 18:16.320
You guys don't need to be that nervous.

18:17.560 --> 18:20.320
After all, our target is Gao Yan.

18:41.520 --> 18:42.920
How can you sit here drinking tea?

18:43.600 --> 18:45.160
Hurry and escape!

18:49.720 --> 18:51.840
Wait. Did you know about this long ago?

18:57.000 --> 18:58.360
You're cunning, aren't you?

18:59.520 --> 19:00.800
You held back.

19:00.880 --> 19:01.960
Let them make the first move.

19:02.040 --> 19:04.120
Now you have grounds to act in the open.

19:04.960 --> 19:06.040
Am I right?

19:08.520 --> 19:09.760
You are indeed intelligent.

19:13.600 --> 19:14.440
But…

19:15.600 --> 19:17.200
But my men

19:17.280 --> 19:19.120
have subdued all of your men.

19:21.200 --> 19:22.800
If so,

19:22.880 --> 19:26.800
does that mean your plan won't succeed?

19:41.000 --> 19:43.680
No matter what,
the commanders' hitmen will arrive soon.

19:43.760 --> 19:45.120
We'd better make a run for it.

19:46.800 --> 19:47.640
I'm not leaving.

19:50.640 --> 19:52.000
If I leave, it means I yield.

19:53.360 --> 19:55.600
Old people like us hate losing, you know?

19:55.680 --> 19:57.760
What are you saying?
What exactly do you want?

19:57.840 --> 19:59.720
You won't get to leave
when they arrive, you know?

19:59.800 --> 20:01.160
Your men

20:02.000 --> 20:04.760
have subdued my men,
causing my plan to be thwarted.

20:04.840 --> 20:07.360
And now, I'm in danger because of you.

20:07.440 --> 20:11.040
You should be the one
coming up with a solution for me.

20:16.320 --> 20:17.920
Do you want me to find you a way out?

20:20.640 --> 20:21.720
Are you sure about that?

20:31.840 --> 20:34.120
Help!

20:34.200 --> 20:36.960
Someone's trying to kill
the regional military commanders!

20:37.600 --> 20:38.920
Help!

20:39.640 --> 20:41.960
Someone's trying to kill
the regional military commanders!

20:42.040 --> 20:43.680
Help!

20:44.280 --> 20:47.720
Regional military commanders, run away!

20:47.800 --> 20:49.600
Someone's after your lives!

20:49.680 --> 20:51.400
Run away!

20:51.480 --> 20:54.160
Someone's trying to
kill the regional military commanders!

20:55.000 --> 20:58.000
Regional military commanders, run away!

20:58.080 --> 20:59.920
-Someone's after your lives!
-What is he up to?

21:01.240 --> 21:03.920
Someone's trying to kill
the regional military commanders!

21:04.000 --> 21:06.000
Regional military commanders, run away!

21:06.080 --> 21:07.720
Did you give them the wrong order?

21:08.240 --> 21:10.760
Do I look that foolish to you?

21:10.840 --> 21:12.120
This seems like…

21:12.200 --> 21:13.840
It's a trap laid by Gao Yan.

21:14.360 --> 21:15.840
He's trying to kill us.

21:53.040 --> 21:55.280
This is what we call a feint attack.

21:56.800 --> 21:59.360
I assume the hitmen have rushed back
to rescue their commanders.

22:10.760 --> 22:11.840
Chancellor,

22:11.920 --> 22:13.960
we've already dealt
with the hitmen outside.

22:18.680 --> 22:19.840
What about the four main targets?

22:19.920 --> 22:21.080
Don't worry.

22:21.840 --> 22:23.600
Our men are keeping an eye on them.

22:25.760 --> 22:27.520
-Time to get to work.
-No, you mustn't!

22:31.280 --> 22:32.480
Yan Fengshan is returning to the Capital.

22:32.560 --> 22:34.600
I assume to bargain with the commanders.

22:34.680 --> 22:35.960
If you kill them now,

22:36.040 --> 22:38.080
we'll have no bait to lure
Yan Fengshan back.

22:54.320 --> 22:55.360
This is my proof.

23:03.360 --> 23:04.200
My master, Xie Huai'an,

23:05.200 --> 23:08.120
is already coming up
with a way to deal with Yan Fengshan.

23:17.000 --> 23:17.960
Your Majesty,

23:18.720 --> 23:19.720
you should be the one

23:20.360 --> 23:21.760
who makes the call.

23:34.400 --> 23:36.120
‎EXQUISITE DELICACIES

23:51.320 --> 23:53.680
I suppose a young man like you
is still filled with fear

23:54.320 --> 23:56.120
when you see the ruler of the land.

24:00.560 --> 24:01.400
Raise your head.

24:08.200 --> 24:10.040
Nothing is more important

24:10.720 --> 24:12.680
than killing Yan Fengshan.

24:13.600 --> 24:14.440
Understood?

24:17.880 --> 24:18.720
Do you understand?

24:24.360 --> 24:28.320
I… I'm done here.

24:29.000 --> 24:30.120
I'll make a move.

24:50.720 --> 24:52.120
After all these years,

24:52.840 --> 24:54.680
to think that you're the first person

24:54.760 --> 24:57.440
to come within five steps of my reach

24:58.800 --> 25:00.040
with a weapon on you.

25:01.440 --> 25:03.520
It seems we're too careless.

25:04.120 --> 25:05.080
Indeed.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.320
Even the best plans have flaws.

25:18.600 --> 25:20.000
Go!

25:23.480 --> 25:24.640
What's the situation?

25:24.720 --> 25:26.920
Every man we sent after Chancellor Gao
is dead.

25:27.000 --> 25:28.360
However,

25:29.120 --> 25:31.320
his men posted outside have pulled back.

25:33.480 --> 25:34.960
It is finally over.

25:35.040 --> 25:36.360
That was a close shave.

25:36.960 --> 25:38.400
If that person hadn't shouted for help,

25:38.480 --> 25:40.320
we'd have thought
everything was under control.

25:40.400 --> 25:41.680
We almost fell for his trap.

25:42.280 --> 25:44.120
If I must say,

25:44.200 --> 25:46.120
we're not really good at coming up
with schemes either.

25:46.720 --> 25:49.000
Am I right, Wang Pu?

25:59.480 --> 26:00.920
If they dare move against you,

26:01.600 --> 26:02.800
they'll dare move against me.

26:02.880 --> 26:06.320
The four of them would never
dare such boldness on their own.

26:07.280 --> 26:08.120
Indeed.

26:09.000 --> 26:10.000
In my opinion,

26:10.080 --> 26:11.360
it'll be better to kill them

26:11.440 --> 26:14.120
than to let them ally themselves
with the Huben Army.

26:14.200 --> 26:15.040
Now, it seems like

26:15.120 --> 26:18.280
the covenant between them
has long been established.

26:22.200 --> 26:24.360
Right now, only two things

26:24.440 --> 26:25.720
can change the current situation.

26:26.960 --> 26:29.440
Either Gu Yu staying alive or

26:30.560 --> 26:32.480
Yan Fengshan dying.

26:35.680 --> 26:36.920
We should leave both tasks

26:38.200 --> 26:39.800
to White Hair.

26:46.960 --> 26:48.440
General Gao, you have great foresight.

26:49.960 --> 26:51.880
I would've bought this alley as well

26:52.880 --> 26:54.520
if I were as rich as you all.

26:54.600 --> 26:56.440
You're young and talented.

26:56.520 --> 27:00.200
You might end up
owning half of the city in the future.

27:01.280 --> 27:02.720
You're still in the mood to eat?

27:02.800 --> 27:06.000
Now, we've already fallen out
with Xiao Wuyang.

27:06.080 --> 27:08.360
I'll see what else you've got planned.

27:12.480 --> 27:13.440
I've nothing else planned.

27:15.680 --> 27:17.760
But, you don't need to panic.

27:18.560 --> 27:19.840
Up next,

27:19.920 --> 27:21.880
General Fengshan will soon
join the fray himself.

27:27.680 --> 27:28.880
Please look forward

27:30.320 --> 27:31.840
to it.

27:42.080 --> 27:43.240
Thank you.

27:44.520 --> 27:47.000
You accepted Gu Yu's recommendation
to go to the Capital back then.

27:47.080 --> 27:48.440
According to the plan,

27:48.520 --> 27:51.200
I assume you'll be sparing Xiao Wenjing.

27:51.280 --> 27:52.120
Indeed.

27:53.000 --> 27:54.360
Why is that?

27:54.440 --> 27:56.480
It's because of a misunderstanding.

27:57.240 --> 27:58.200
A misunderstanding?

28:05.640 --> 28:08.560
The current emperor
is weak and incompetent.

28:10.440 --> 28:12.880
He might as well
not have taken the throne.

28:13.800 --> 28:15.280
He should

28:16.440 --> 28:18.920
become a scholar instead.

28:19.800 --> 28:21.120
That's right!

28:22.960 --> 28:24.880
He doesn't even have the freedom
to choose.

28:24.960 --> 28:26.480
If he had the freedom to choose,

28:27.080 --> 28:29.640
perhaps he wouldn't have wanted
to be the emperor.

28:31.320 --> 28:32.280
What a poor soul.

28:33.360 --> 28:34.600
What a poor soul!

28:35.520 --> 28:37.760
To the poor soul called the emperor.

28:40.680 --> 28:41.640
Come!

28:43.000 --> 28:45.080
To the poor soul called the emperor!

28:45.640 --> 28:47.080
To him!

29:06.160 --> 29:07.120
What are you doing?

29:07.200 --> 29:08.320
What are you doing?

29:08.400 --> 29:09.560
Yan Fengshan,

29:09.640 --> 29:11.560
didn't you say
that I could enjoy myself outside

29:11.640 --> 29:13.120
for two hours each month?

29:13.200 --> 29:14.680
Has it even been two hours?

29:20.720 --> 29:22.600
I want to drink more!

29:23.520 --> 29:26.000
I haven't had my fill yet.

29:26.080 --> 29:27.400
I don't want to go back!

29:27.480 --> 29:28.320
I won't go back!

29:28.400 --> 29:30.080
I want to keep drinking!

29:30.160 --> 29:31.440
I want to keep drinking!

29:31.520 --> 29:33.000
I want to keep drinking!

29:33.840 --> 29:35.200
I don't want to go back!

29:39.800 --> 29:41.120
Only then did I find out

29:41.760 --> 29:44.080
that he was suppressed by
Yan Fengshan all along.

29:44.160 --> 29:45.680
Although he was the emperor,

29:46.400 --> 29:48.880
in reality, he was just a bird
living in a cage.

29:52.680 --> 29:53.840
After that,

29:54.560 --> 29:56.600
I went through many of his manuscripts.

29:56.680 --> 29:58.320
These four lines
left a deep impression on me.

29:59.360 --> 30:00.600
"For those who would be ministers,

30:00.680 --> 30:02.680
discern right from wrong,
heed not gain or loss."

30:02.760 --> 30:05.080
"For those who would be soldiers,
hold realm and kin above all,

30:05.160 --> 30:06.320
count not life or death."

30:06.400 --> 30:07.680
"For those who would be sovereign,

30:07.760 --> 30:09.680
hear the people's woes,
seek not glory nor splendor."

30:10.480 --> 30:13.120
"And for those
who would be common folk,

30:13.200 --> 30:14.400
keep to their fields and livelihood,

30:14.480 --> 30:15.320
fret not over prices."

30:15.400 --> 30:17.120
Especially the last part.

30:17.760 --> 30:19.160
Although his writing wasn't refined,

30:19.760 --> 30:23.320
from it, I could tell
that he cared for his people.

30:25.240 --> 30:27.200
He wrote those
when he was the crown prince.

30:28.160 --> 30:30.000
He wrote them
with an innocent heart back then.

30:30.920 --> 30:32.040
What a shame.

30:32.720 --> 30:35.000
He proved to be too soft
after ascending the throne.

30:35.080 --> 30:36.800
He was suppressed by Yan Fengshan
for many years.

30:37.440 --> 30:39.360
He was unable to establish a peaceful era.

30:42.120 --> 30:43.520
Times have changed indeed.

30:44.240 --> 30:45.360
Now,

30:45.440 --> 30:48.000
there probably isn't anyone
who wants him to remain emperor.

30:49.240 --> 30:50.880
I'm the only stubborn one
who won't change.

30:55.840 --> 30:56.680
Huai'an.

30:59.640 --> 31:01.200
I've prepared a letter.

31:01.280 --> 31:03.280
If anything happens to me,

31:05.120 --> 31:06.200
please deliver this

31:07.400 --> 31:08.240
to him.

31:19.400 --> 31:20.240
All right.

31:20.960 --> 31:22.760
Do you know where he is?

31:25.360 --> 31:26.320
I do not.

31:27.720 --> 31:31.240
But I'm sure he's also staring
at the same moon as we are.

31:40.240 --> 31:41.160
Hey.

31:42.480 --> 31:44.200
What exactly have you
experienced out there?

31:46.200 --> 31:47.480
It's as if you're a different man now.

31:49.360 --> 31:50.720
You didn't bungle anything either.

31:58.360 --> 31:59.240
Nasty One.

32:03.280 --> 32:04.120
What's the matter?

32:05.280 --> 32:06.160
What's on your mind?

32:07.800 --> 32:08.880
I met my elder brother.

32:08.960 --> 32:10.000
Who's your elder brother?

32:12.320 --> 32:13.160
You mean Xiao Wuyang?

32:14.440 --> 32:15.960
And, you actually left in one piece?

32:16.880 --> 32:18.320
He didn't intend to kill me.

32:20.080 --> 32:21.800
He couldn't even recognize me.

32:22.720 --> 32:24.320
But what's even stranger

32:26.200 --> 32:28.360
is that I didn't feel like
killing him either.

32:29.200 --> 32:30.720
Logically speaking,

32:31.560 --> 32:33.400
he took my empire from me.

32:33.480 --> 32:36.280
Thanks to him, I ended up like this
and became a pageboy.

32:36.880 --> 32:40.520
From a life of luxury
to chopping wood and cooking meals…

32:40.600 --> 32:42.280
I was once above everyone else.

32:42.880 --> 32:44.200
And now, I'm not.

32:46.720 --> 32:48.640
I should've hated him for it.

32:50.040 --> 32:51.720
But when I met him,

32:51.800 --> 32:52.960
I only realized

32:53.880 --> 32:55.920
that I hated the bully at Wazi Alley

32:56.600 --> 32:57.920
much more than him.

33:04.880 --> 33:05.760
Perhaps

33:06.800 --> 33:08.840
I don't love the empire
as much as I thought.

33:10.320 --> 33:11.520
Even so,

33:12.640 --> 33:13.920
there's nothing wrong with it.

33:15.960 --> 33:16.960
But you see,

33:17.960 --> 33:19.880
it's not as if any beauties here
could lead me astray.

33:25.120 --> 33:26.440
Why are you staring at me like that?

33:27.040 --> 33:29.320
The person beside me
is either you or Huai'an.

33:31.680 --> 33:32.840
Zhaolu isn't around either.

33:37.040 --> 33:38.680
Stop acting like that.

33:40.120 --> 33:41.960
I'm not used to you being this down.

33:44.200 --> 33:45.960
I prefer you when you're a nasty brat.

33:49.640 --> 33:50.480
Thanks for that.

33:53.880 --> 33:54.880
That's more like it.

34:11.280 --> 34:12.800
Did everything go smoothly last night?

34:12.880 --> 34:13.800
Were you hurt?

34:14.400 --> 34:15.520
I wasn't hurt.

34:16.360 --> 34:17.400
I claim no credit.

34:19.360 --> 34:20.360
Last night's success

34:20.440 --> 34:22.320
was all thanks to
Nasty One's quick thinking.

34:26.440 --> 34:29.080
He's both observant and witty.

34:30.120 --> 34:30.960
No wonder they admire him.

34:32.639 --> 34:33.600
People admire him?

34:33.679 --> 34:35.360
What a joke.

34:37.480 --> 34:39.000
But speaking of which,

34:39.080 --> 34:40.840
he can be quite amusing

34:42.040 --> 34:43.440
at times.

34:47.600 --> 34:48.440
Huai'an.

34:50.400 --> 34:51.480
Speaking of which,

34:52.400 --> 34:54.040
what do you plan to do

34:54.880 --> 34:55.920
once everything is over?

35:00.840 --> 35:03.320
What do you mean?
What are you trying to get at?

35:08.680 --> 35:09.960
Once everything is over,

35:11.520 --> 35:12.720
you should reunite with Bai Wan.

35:14.120 --> 35:15.560
You'll soften up a bit

35:16.400 --> 35:17.840
with loved ones by your side.

36:20.880 --> 36:22.120
Mr. Wang Pu, what brings you here?

36:25.360 --> 36:27.160
Mr. Wang, let me do the dirty chores.

36:27.240 --> 36:28.400
Do not soil your hands.

36:29.040 --> 36:30.360
It's fine.

36:34.360 --> 36:36.240
You did a great job at categorizing them.

36:38.600 --> 36:41.280
From east to west, from south to north,

36:41.360 --> 36:43.720
every alley and every household
you collected from,

36:43.800 --> 36:45.160
you marked.

36:47.120 --> 36:48.200
Why did you do it?

36:50.240 --> 36:52.040
Mr. Wang, please spare me. I can explain.

36:52.120 --> 36:53.080
I can explain.

36:56.720 --> 36:57.560
Explain yourself, then.

36:59.920 --> 37:01.240
Mr. Wang,

37:01.320 --> 37:02.800
I did the same job for seven years

37:02.880 --> 37:04.720
prior to joining Hidden Soldier Alley.

37:04.800 --> 37:06.280
I was already used to categorizing items.

37:06.360 --> 37:07.880
And, I'm quick to snatch up bargains.

37:07.960 --> 37:09.000
There's always a bargain

37:09.080 --> 37:10.480
in the places I know.

37:12.560 --> 37:13.400
Mr. Wang, look.

37:14.320 --> 37:16.440
This is a tattered fabric
from a fabric shop.

37:16.520 --> 37:17.680
This kind of fabric

37:17.760 --> 37:19.400
is good enough
for someone like me to wear.

37:20.640 --> 37:22.720
And, as for the damp herbs collected
from the pharmacies,

37:22.800 --> 37:24.440
I dried them after collecting them.

37:24.520 --> 37:25.560
I can now resell them.

37:25.640 --> 37:28.080
As for the wealthy families
living in the alley…

37:28.160 --> 37:29.080
Understood.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.840
You're smart.

37:34.320 --> 37:37.400
Later, I'll assign other tasks to you.

37:41.360 --> 37:42.960
-But,
-Mr. Wang,

37:43.880 --> 37:44.720
right now, I…

37:45.320 --> 37:46.800
You'll earn far more
than scavenging trash.

37:48.480 --> 37:50.680
Thank you, Mr. Wang. Thank you, Mr. Wang.

37:50.760 --> 37:51.600
Thank you, Mr. Wang.

38:01.440 --> 38:02.720
Mr. Wang,

38:02.800 --> 38:04.680
may I know why you came to
such a place personally?

38:06.240 --> 38:07.400
I'm looking for someone.

38:12.640 --> 38:13.680
I don't understand.

38:21.080 --> 38:23.920
Lately, quite a few outsiders have been
sneaking into Hidden Soldier Alley.

38:24.000 --> 38:25.440
I have to locate them.

38:28.320 --> 38:29.600
No matter how well they hide,

38:29.680 --> 38:31.440
they'll surely leave behind some tracks

38:31.520 --> 38:33.080
as long as they live here.

38:34.320 --> 38:38.360
And trash is where traces
are most easily left behind.

38:38.960 --> 38:40.520
Why else do you suppose

38:41.160 --> 38:43.640
I was able to find
the Baiwenhu soldier among our ranks?

38:49.040 --> 38:51.600
I've visited this place several times.

38:52.200 --> 38:54.120
I suppose I have to thank you

38:54.200 --> 38:56.360
for the excellent categorization.

39:02.560 --> 39:03.960
Since they intend to rescue Gu Yu,

39:04.880 --> 39:06.760
I'm sure they won't come alone.

39:32.720 --> 39:33.560
I found it.

39:38.240 --> 39:39.400
Mr. Wang, what is this?

39:42.640 --> 39:44.280
The Baiwenhu Army stayed
on the frontier year-round.

39:44.360 --> 39:46.840
And, the northern regions
are bitterly cold.

39:47.720 --> 39:49.040
Therefore,

39:49.120 --> 39:50.920
the Gu family hired a famous physician

39:51.000 --> 39:52.520
to develop a medicinal plaster

39:52.600 --> 39:55.040
that could relieve knee pain.

40:05.440 --> 40:07.600
I think I found their den.

40:14.320 --> 40:15.760
West Third Alley,

40:16.480 --> 40:17.600
Unit 8.

41:14.040 --> 41:15.680
Wang Pu found your tracks.

42:17.720 --> 42:19.040
This trash wasn't here before.

42:20.080 --> 42:22.320
You're right. Someone tampered with it.

42:24.000 --> 42:25.400
Thank you for the reminder.

42:25.480 --> 42:27.040
Otherwise, I'd still be in the dark.

42:28.160 --> 42:29.040
But speaking of which,

42:31.000 --> 42:31.880
how did you find out?

42:32.960 --> 42:33.920
It's because you told me

42:34.680 --> 42:36.200
Wang Pu killed a Baiwenhu soldier.

42:37.040 --> 42:39.200
The Baiwenhu Army
has gone through countless battles.

42:39.280 --> 42:41.080
Generally, they don't give away any clues.

42:42.160 --> 42:44.560
But Wang Pu is the top strategist
under Yan Fengshan.

42:44.640 --> 42:46.480
Therefore, he's more meticulous
than others.

42:48.680 --> 42:49.840
Since we can

42:49.920 --> 42:52.800
use trash to investigate
Hidden Soldier Alley,

42:52.880 --> 42:55.160
of course they can
use the same way to locate

42:55.240 --> 42:56.120
the Baiwenhu Army.

42:56.760 --> 42:58.280
How many of them remain hidden here?

42:59.200 --> 43:01.400
I've already transferred
the rest of them away.

43:01.480 --> 43:03.720
According to the information you gave me,

43:03.800 --> 43:06.800
several residences to the west
are already vacant.

43:09.200 --> 43:11.960
This is the complete map
of the Hidden Soldier Alley base.

43:12.040 --> 43:13.920
We've marked everything we found out

43:14.000 --> 43:15.520
on this map.

43:16.120 --> 43:18.680
The key to the operation
lies at Zuihua Tower.

43:18.760 --> 43:19.680
ZUIHUA TOWER

43:19.760 --> 43:20.960
The shops on both sides

43:21.040 --> 43:22.680
of the street,
and the Huben soldiers as well,

43:22.760 --> 43:25.760
were all posted here
to keep watch and lie in ambush.

43:26.760 --> 43:27.600
Where are the goods?

43:28.280 --> 43:30.080
They are ready.
We're merely biding our time.

43:32.320 --> 43:33.400
The sun will set soon.

43:33.480 --> 43:35.320
It's time to act.

43:50.040 --> 43:51.440
Act according to the plan.

43:51.520 --> 43:52.400
At the very end,

43:52.480 --> 43:54.640
we will evacuate the general
from the designated location.

43:55.760 --> 43:57.200
The Huben Army will chase us hard.

43:58.360 --> 43:59.600
You must be careful.

43:59.680 --> 44:00.920
Don't worry.

44:01.000 --> 44:03.360
My friend and I will make it in time.

44:04.440 --> 44:06.760
This time, the Baiwenhu Army owes you one.

44:35.640 --> 44:36.680
Has it begun?

44:37.360 --> 44:38.440
It has.

46:24.840 --> 46:25.800
Wang Pu,

46:26.800 --> 46:29.200
the top strategist under Yan Fengshan.

46:29.280 --> 46:30.440
How long do you think

46:30.520 --> 46:32.600
it'll take for him to notice
that you've rescued Gu Yu?
